WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.569
-Now, I thought I'd share some
of my favorite #carfails

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.037
from you guys.
Here we go.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:06.673
First one's from @CTaylor8.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.875
She said, "My dad once hired
a taxi to drive him

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:09.909
around the mall parking lot

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.177
because he couldn't
find his car."

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.512
[ Laughter ]
-Wow.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.714
-I've been there.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.182
This one's from @brendaemily.

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:19.118
She says, "One night,
I was coming up on a red light

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:21.854
when my flip flop got stuck
so that, when I hit the brakes,

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.890
the gas pushed down."

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.224
No, "The gas pushed down, too.

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:27.060
I hit a truck
in front of me, panicked

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.929
&amp; kept tugging my flip flop,
hitting him again and again."

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.764
[ Laughter and clapping ]
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:33.566
I'm sorry!

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.134
[muffled] I'm in the trunk!

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:36.802
[ Chuckle ]

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:39.239
This one's from @Celizabeth107.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:41.975
She says, "After the windshield
wipers on our family car broke,

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.242
my mom tied a string to them

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.111
and would 'pull and release'
when it rained."

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.914
[ Laughter ]
Come on.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.415
-[Laughing]

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.217
-It was a lot of work.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.253
This one's from @beer stat.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.687
Yeah!

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.856
-Is that "Gimme like
beer, stat"?

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.925
Like that?
-No. Maybe like beer stat,

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.660
Both:
like beer statistics.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.764
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.699
He says,
"My dad owned an arcade

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.334
that specialized in slot cars

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.737
and his name was painted
on the side of his van,

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.805
so I got to spend high school
driving around in a van

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:14.240
that said Hot Slots on it.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:19.045
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.113
This one's from @NewsomScoob.

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:22.515
Oh, I know.
-Oh, yeah, you know Newsom.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.250
He says, "I was playing
'Dream On'

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.518
as loud as I could in my car.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:26.852
A pebble flew up
and cracked the windshield.

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:29.188
For a second,
I thought Steven Tyler's voice

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:31.390
[ Laughter ]
broke the glass." It's like

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:32.725
he's that good!

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.193
[ Applause ]

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.062
[high-pitched]
♪ Dream on ♪

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.765
This one's from @KleoPotato.
-Oh.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.733
-She says, "I was driving
down a hill one time

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:41.900
when my brakes stopped working.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:42.902
Right at that moment,

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.170
'Highway to Hell'
came on the radio.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.205
[ Laughter and applause ]
All I could do was laugh

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:47.773
and await my death."

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:50.710
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.145
-[Laughing]

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.946
-That's just perfect, yeah.
-Oh!

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.383
-Down shift.
This one's from @allieshite.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:02:00.420
She says, "In high school,
I had to stick a screwdriver

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.689
into a hole in the console
to put my Subaru in gear.

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.892
That's how it got named
the Screwbaru."

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:07.660
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.528
[ Applause ]
-That's how it got named.

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:11.029
-That's how it got named. Sure.

00:02:11.029 --> 00:02:12.365
That's a bunch of sh.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:14.200
That's a bunch of shite.
Yeah.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.537
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:20.373
Bunch of.
That is a lot of shite,

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.908
but that's from @allieshite.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.209
-Yeah, yeah, God bless her.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.211
The Screwbaru.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.445
-That's how it got the name.
-That's what she told

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:27.547
her mom, yeah.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:30.350
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.617
-Ugh!

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:34.753
This one's from @pottsyMJ.
-Yeah.

00:02:34.753 --> 00:02:36.422
He says, "My mom was
driving me somewhere

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:38.624
and stopped at a light.
She rested her forearms

00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:40.693
on the wheel and wondered
who was 'honking so loudly?'

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:43.195
Turns out her breasts
were pushing her own horn!!"

00:02:43.195 --> 00:02:45.498
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:48.635
-[Cackling]

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.036
-Wait!

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.671
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:53.273
Wait!
-What?!

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:56.308
I don't know what's going on.
-Wait!

00:02:56.308 --> 00:02:59.411
-This last one is
from Craig Lefferts.

00:02:59.411 --> 00:03:01.981
He says, "I accidentally rear
ended the person in front of me

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.282
while my daughter was
in the car.

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:04.817
Everyone was fine,
but my daughter went around

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.353
telling people that our car
kissed another car's butt."

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:08.354
[ Cheering and applause ]
There you go. There's our

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:09.522
"Tonight Show" hashtag.

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:10.856
To check out more
of our favorites,

00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:14.060
go to
tonightshow.com/hashtags.

